[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 13800.63, "timestamp": "03:50:00", "text": "31号，我当时就懵了，但后来你说……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13803.269, "timestamp": "03:50:03", "text": "你以为是七月份的吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13807.349, "timestamp": "03:50:07", "text": "某物。是的。是的。所以你发了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13810.229, "timestamp": "03:50:10", "text": "七月的那些日子，或者说这几天"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13812.63, "timestamp": "03:50:12", "text": "上星期？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13816.229, "timestamp": "03:50:16", "text": "我觉得是六月份。啊，六月真好。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13817.83, "timestamp": "03:50:17", "text": "六月。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13820.07, "timestamp": "03:50:20", "text": "是的，那些日期就是那些日期。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13821.99, "timestamp": "03:50:21", "text": "比如六月份的时候，但是后来，嗯，我就想……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13826.79, "timestamp": "03:50:26", "text": "今天和明天都有些空闲时间。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13829.15, "timestamp": "03:50:29", "text": "是的，我很高兴我能得到"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13832.95, "timestamp": "03:50:32", "text": "你。我会非常难过"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13837.269, "timestamp": "03:50:37", "text": "不，我没法拿到DSG变速箱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13839.429, "timestamp": "03:50:39", "text": "不，我其实更高兴的是你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13841.87, "timestamp": "03:50:41", "text": "他居然给我打了电话。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13845.03, "timestamp": "03:50:45", "text": "是啊，因为我想聊聊天，想……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13848.389, "timestamp": "03:50:48", "text": "经常一起出去玩，但已经很久没见了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13852.63, "timestamp": "03:50:52", "text": "今天我们有很多事情要赶上。我很高兴"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13855.11, "timestamp": "03:50:55", "text": "又下雨了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13856.95, "timestamp": "03:50:56", "text": "我的意思是，这里一直在下雨。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 13858.55, "timestamp": "03:50:58", "text": "兄弟。比如，好吧，今天早上我们"}]